> - 空间关系类：frequency_rank, along_main_axis, diagonal_pairing, distance_determines_palette, centroid_offset_positioning, relative_position_determines_color, row_boundary_pairing, color_matching, border_aligned, four_neighbor_connect, diag_index_map, mirror_symmetry, bilateral_alignment, connectivity_reachable, nearest_corner_dist, period
> - 条件/判断类：minority_replaced, hollow_only_retained, ignore_distractors, parity_dash, cyclic_color_bands, centroid_direction_maps_to_slot, quadrant_border_layer, row_span_fill, symbol_to_color_mapping, rarest_color_as_anchor, repeated_color_moves, stop_at_gate, cyclic_header_doubled, uniform_color_replacement, recolor_if_mirror_pair, union_merge, seed_color_labels_fill, flip_cropped, smallest_period_flipped, solid_is_valid, cell_interior_test, min_manhattan
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

